      "content": "it's hard to even talk to people about it. they all just want me to 'keep pushing' or 'stay positive' like that's some magic fix for the fact that my entire life is basically a failure now. it feels like i'm just running in circles for no reason. everything is so loud and exhausting and there's just nothing left to give. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise is to just... stop.",
